 features, large expressive blue eyes with intricate iris details, and a serene facial expression with a slight hint of a smile. She has chin-length platinum blonde hair with a sleek texture, styled with a voluminous bob and a sleek white headband. She wears a sophisticated black leather and silk outfit featuring a corset-style bodice with gold filigree patterns, ruffled shoulder pads, and feathered lace accents on her arms. She is wearing white thigh-high boots with a glossy satin finish and sheer black stockings with a subtle seam. She is sitting gracefully on a luxurious deep red leather Chesterfield sofa with ornate gold carvings. The composition follows a golden ratio, showcasing her elegant posture with one leg crossed over the other. The background consists of dark moody drapes with dramatic volumetric lighting and a warm rim light highlighting her silhouette. Shot on Sony A7R IV, 85mm f/1.8 lens, sharp focus on the eyes, creamy bokeh, high contrast, rich textures of leather and silk, 8k resolution."]},{"id":16,"type":"SaveImage","pos":[119.82602436082996,238.1456532226261],"size":[460,361.6363636363635],"flags":{},"order":21,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图片","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":15},{"localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.26.0","Node name for S&R":"SaveImage","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["images/krea2/controlnet/cine"]}],"links":[[2,2,0,3,0,"LATENT"],[3,4,0,3,1,"VAE"],[5,6,0,2,1,"CONDITIONING"],[8,8,0,2,2,"CONDITIONING"],[11,10,0,2,3,"LATENT"],[12,6,0,8,0,"CONDITIONING"],[14,13,0,6,0,"CLIP"],[15,3,0,16,0,"IMAGE"],[63,52,0,51,0,"IMAGE"],[66,1,0,54,0,"MODEL"],[67,51,0,55,0,"IMAGE"],[68,54,0,56,0,"MODEL"],[69,55,0,56,1,"LATENT"],[70,55,1,57,0,"IMAGE"],[71,4